# The image's build context. The Dockerfile copies package*.json, packages,
# go.mod, cmd and internal; the ui stage installs the modules and builds the
# UI and the SDK itself, so nothing installed or built in a checkout (or a
# worktree, or git's own files) may reach the image (T-115). The Go stage
# takes internal/webui/dist from the ui stage, never from here.
.git
worktrees
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
